column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFE100\"><\u002Fspan><h3 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">SEO-ready build<\u002Fh3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#BDBDBD\">Clean headings, schema, image optimisation and fast load times as standard.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv>\n        <div style=\"border-radius:18px;background:#1C1C1C;padding:22px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px\"><span style=\"width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:#FFFFFF\"><\u002Fspan><h3 style=\"margin:8px 0 0;font-weight:500;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">Local support in IST<\u002Fh3><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#BDBDBD\">Calls in Tamil or English, weekly updates, replies within 24 hours.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n\n      <div style=\"margin-top:clamp(56px,7vw,88px);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:16px\">\n        <h3 style=\"margin:0;font-weight:500;font-size:clamp(26px,2.8vw,38px);letter-spacing:-0.045em\">Four steps. <span style=\"color:#8A8A8A\">No surprises.<\u002Fspan><\u002Fh3>\n        <span style=\"font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#BDBDBD\">Typical project · 6 weeks<\u002Fspan>\n      <\u002Fdiv>\n      <div style=\"margin-top:28px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(min(100%,220px),1fr));gap:0;border-top:1px solid #333\">\n        <div style=\"padding:24px 24px 8px 0;border-right:1px solid #333\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:'Geist Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#8A8A8A\"><span>01<\u002Fspan><span>Week 1<\u002Fspan><\u002Fdiv><h4 style=\"margin:28px 0 8px;font-weight:500;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:-0.03em\">Discovery<\u002Fh4><p style=\"margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#BDBDBD\">Goals, audience, scope, timeline and a fixed price.<\u002Fp><\u002Fdiv>\n        <